<title>USA: Unisys adds products under NASA contract.</title>
<headline>Unisys adds products under NASA contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Micron Electronics Inc workstations and American Mobile Satellite Corp voice, data and fax communications services are now available under a NASA procurement contract with Unisys.</p>
<p>Also, Unisys said it added Cabletron Systems Inc's SmartSwitch 6000 and 2200 - for wiring closets and workgroup switches, to the contract with the National Aeronautics and Space Administration.</p>
